### Techniker erfassen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/techniker
Content-Type: application/json

{"kuerzel": "AMU", "vorname": "Anna", "nachname": "Muster"}

### Gleiches Kuerzel nochmals -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/techniker
Content-Type: application/json

{"kuerzel": "AMU", "vorname": "Andreas", "nachname": "Muster"}

### Ungueltiges Kuerzel -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/techniker
Content-Type: application/json

{"kuerzel": "am1", "vorname": "Anna", "nachname": "Muster"}

### Techniker lesen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/techniker/1

### Techniker aendern
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/techniker/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"vorname": "Anna", "nachname": "Muster-Beispiel"}

### Techniker deaktivieren
POST http://localhost:8080/api/techniker/1/deaktivieren
